8000 REM SPRITE INIT - LOAD DATA, SET POINTER AND COLORS
8005 REM DATA POINTER ALREADY ADVANCED BY CHARSET INIT; READ 64 SPRITE BYTES
8006 REM LOAD TO $3800 (14336): FREE, PROTECTED (>$3000), INSIDE VIC BANK 0
8007 FOR X=14336 TO 14336+63:READ Y:POKE X,Y:NEXT X
8020 POKE 2040,224:REM SPRITE 0 POINTER (224*64=14336=$3800)
8030 POKE 53287,3:REM SPRITE 0 COLOR
8040 POKE 53285,10:REM MULTICOLOR 1
8050 POKE 53286,15:REM MULTICOLOR 2
8060 POKE 53276,PEEK(53276)OR 1:REM SPRITE 0 MULTICOLOR ON
8070 POKE 53277,PEEK(53277)AND 254:REM SPRITE 0 NORMAL WIDTH
8080 POKE 53271,PEEK(53271)AND 254:REM SPRITE 0 NORMAL HEIGHT
8090 RETURN

8100 REM SHOW SHIP - SPRITE 0
